[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Module Requirements — rules.py, hooks.py, commands.py

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-RULES-001
TITLE: load_rules_sources — Gather Rules from All Layers
STATEMENT: >>>
Enumerate all .md files in rules/1-generic/ and rules/2-platform/<platform>-*.md.
Priority: 2-platform > 1-generic. Return: dict {rule_name: {source, file, layer}}.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Layered rule sources enable platform-specific policy customization while maintaining
universal base rules.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_rules.py::test_load_rules_sources_priority
- tests/test_rules.py::test_load_rules_sources_platform_overrides
<<<
TAGS: rules, loading, layering
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: implements
  VALUE: REQ-SYS-007
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-RULES-003

