[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-RULES-003
TITLE: sync_rules — Write Rules to Provider Directories
STATEMENT: >>>
For each provider: load rules, validate, substitute variables, write to
provider rules_dir, update .agent-meta-managed index, cleanup stale rules.
Idempotent: re-running doesn't duplicate.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Provider-specific rule sync ensures each provider gets correctly configured policies
without cross-provider pollution.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_rules.py::test_sync_rules_idempotent
- tests/test_rules.py::test_sync_rules_cleanup_stale
<<<
TAGS: rules, sync, provider
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
